cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the system paper below."
title: "Christos: CHemistry ReactIng SysTem for OrganicS"
abstract: >-
  A provenance-tracked reaction prediction engine for organic chemistry that
  resolves herbal, natural-product and formula inputs to compound level and
  enumerates condition-constrained transformations without scoring or ranking.
type: software
version: 0.9.0-beta
date-released: "2026-10-20"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/VegFisx/Christos"
url: "https://github.com/VegFisx/Christos"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23499423"

